1	----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2	-- Company: 
3	-- Engineer: 
4	-- 
5	-- Create Date:    19:51:11 05/05/2020 
6	-- Design Name: 
7	-- Module Name:    SPICommands - Behavioral 
8	-- Project Name: 
9	-- Target Devices: 
10	-- Tool versions: 
11	-- Description: 
12	--
13	-- Dependencies: 
14	--
15	-- Revision: 
16	-- Revision 0.01 - File Created
